     A                                      COLHDG('AWP' 'CURRENT' 'EFF DT')
     A*** Begin change 04/25/18 ***************************************
     A***         RXAWP     R               REFFLD(A92)
     A***                                   COLHDG('AWP CURRENT' 'UNIT' 'PRICE')
     A*** Important Note:  This field contains the PER UNIT price
     A***                  It should have been created as a 9.5 instead of 9.2
     A***                  Therefore, any use of it must divide by 1000 of 9.2
     A***         RX1AWP    R               REFFLD(A92)
     A***                                   COLHDG('AWP 1ST' 'PREV UNIT PRICE')
     A*** Important Note:  This field contains the PER UNIT price
     A***                  It should have been created as a 9.5 instead of 9.2
     A***                  Therefore, any use of it must divide by 1000 of 9.2
     A            RXAWP         13S 5       COLHDG('AWP CURRENT' 'UNIT' 'PRICE')
     A
     A            RX1AWP        13S 5       COLHDG('AWP 1ST' 'PREV UNIT PRICE')
     A
     A*** End   change 04/25/18 ***************************************
